"overall": "The psalm is short and mostly moves well in the mouth, with a good urgent close ('Senhor, não demoreis'). The weak points are two calque-sounding joints (2 and the 'em vós todos' tangle in 5), and 4b, where 'imediatamente' and 'Que bom, que bom' drain the scene of its bite. Some Latinate words ('auxílio/auxiliar/auxiliai') recur heavily; the repetition of root in 2 is faithful, but in 6 a plainer verb would pray better.",
"worstLine": "69:4b",
"bestLine": "69:6b"}
